            <node id="n2::n5::n0">
              <data key="d100">Sterol regulatory element-binding protein cleavage-activating protein</data>
              <data key="d104">Escort protein required for cholesterol as well as lipid homeostasis. Regulates export of the SCAP-SREBP complex from the endoplasmic reticulum to the Golgi upon low cholesterol, thereby regulating the processing of sterol regulatory element-binding proteins (SREBPs) SREBF1/SREBP1 and SREBF2/SREBP2.</data>
              <data key="d105">Endoplasmic reticulum membrane, Golgi apparatus membrane, Cytoplasmic vesicle, COPII-coated vesicle membrane</data>
